@title Renumber wires that are already numbered says nothing changes
@area Schematic
# TCN-01: a renumber that lands on the numbers the wires have counted them as renumbered.
click_text "Open example"
wait 20
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text number wires
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
shot numbered
key Escape
wait 5
key ctrl+k
wait 3
text renumber wires
wait 4
key Enter
wait 30
shot renumber-preview
expect "Nothing to change"
check_layout
